@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:登记供应商付款</u>\n<u>与结算控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:采购</u>" as Purchase
participant "<u>:验收</u>" as Receipt
participant "<u>:供应商资金</u>" as SupplierFunds
participant "<u>:供货付款</u>" as SupplyPayment
participant "<u>:供货分配</u>" as SupplyAllocation
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-29办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-29办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
opt 本次付款含采购预付
K -> Purchase : 提供预付依据(确认采购或空)
activate Purchase
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
end
opt 本次付款含验收结算
K -> Receipt : 提供合格结算依据(验收范围或空)
activate Receipt
Receipt --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Receipt
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 确认供货结算范围
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-29办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> SupplierFunds : 确认付款范围(负责人意见及结算依据)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
A0 -> B0 : 申请本次付款办理
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-29办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> SupplierFunds : 开始供货付款(负责人确认范围及拟付额)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds -> SupplyPayment : 建立付款占用(唯一办理依据)
activate SupplyPayment
SupplyPayment --> SupplierFunds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyPayment
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A0 -> B0 : 提交线下实际付款结果
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-29办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> SupplierFunds : 核实实际付款(渠道、实际结果及凭据)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds -> SupplyPayment : 确认实际支出(已核实结果)
activate SupplyPayment
SupplyPayment -> SupplyAllocation : 形成供货分配(采购预付或验收结算)
activate SupplyAllocation
SupplyAllocation --> SupplyPayment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyAllocation
SupplyPayment --> SupplierFunds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyPayment
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,SupplyAllocation
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
